repository-code: "https://github.com/CuiLinWEJ/uniGas_membrane_TdualFlux"

abstract: >
A post-thesis research implementation of a transient dual-flux
permeable membrane boundary model for uniGasFoam. The repository
contains the author's original modifications, example cases, and
documentation for numerical simulations in rarefied gas dynamics.

